        "data": {
            "type": "game",
            "name": "Bottle Flip Challenge VR",
            "steam_appid": 620140,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Dive into the thrilling world of Ultimate Bottle Flip Adventure, where precision and flair lead you to victory! This isn't just any bottle flipping game; it's a journey through diverse and challenging environments, each offering a unique flipping experience that will keep you coming back for more. From the bustling subway stations to serene parks, the vastness of space, and beyond—every level introduces a new twist and turns your flipping skills upside down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiverse Levels: Explore a variety of meticulously designed levels including a lively subway station, a peaceful park, and the weightlessness of space. Each setting tests your skills under different conditions, pushing you to adapt and master the art of bottle flipping.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInnovative Bottles: Why stick to a standard plastic bottle when you can flip a Teleporting Bottle, unleash the Bottle Blaster, or send a Rocket soaring? Our arsenal of unique bottles brings unexpected strategies and excitement to your flipping game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGravity Play: Challenge the laws of physics by playing in levels with varying gravity. Experience the thrill of flipping in low gravity on the moon or push your skills to the limit with high-gravity challenges. Mastering gravity is key to becoming the Ultimate Bottle Flipper.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompetitive Flip Offs: Go head-to-head against computer-controlled opponents in epic flip-offs. Outsmart and outflip your opponents to climb the ranks and prove you're the best around.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScore Big: Perfect your technique to score big points. Execute flawless flips, land complex tricks, and combo your way to the top of the leaderboards. With endless replayability, your next big score is always within reach.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUltimate Bottle Flip Adventure is more than just flipping bottles; it's a test of skill, precision, and creativity. Whether you're looking for a quick flip or aiming to dominate the leaderboards, this game offers endless fun and challenges. So, are you ready to flip, soar, and blast your way to victory? Join the adventure today and become the ultimate bottle flipper!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrab your bottle, set your sights, and flip to greatness!",
            "about_the_game": "Dive into the thrilling world of Ultimate Bottle Flip Adventure, where precision and flair lead you to victory! This isn't just any bottle flipping game; it's a journey through diverse and challenging environments, each offering a unique flipping experience that will keep you coming back for more. From the bustling subway stations to serene parks, the vastness of space, and beyond—every level introduces a new twist and turns your flipping skills upside down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiverse Levels: Explore a variety of meticulously designed levels including a lively subway station, a peaceful park, and the weightlessness of space. Each setting tests your skills under different conditions, pushing you to adapt and master the art of bottle flipping.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInnovative Bottles: Why stick to a standard plastic bottle when you can flip a Teleporting Bottle, unleash the Bottle Blaster, or send a Rocket soaring? Our arsenal of unique bottles brings unexpected strategies and excitement to your flipping game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGravity Play: Challenge the laws of physics by playing in levels with varying gravity. Experience the thrill of flipping in low gravity on the moon or push your skills to the limit with high-gravity challenges. Mastering gravity is key to becoming the Ultimate Bottle Flipper.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompetitive Flip Offs: Go head-to-head against computer-controlled opponents in epic flip-offs. Outsmart and outflip your opponents to climb the ranks and prove you're the best around.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nScore Big: Perfect your technique to score big points. Execute flawless flips, land complex tricks, and combo your way to the top of the leaderboards. With endless replayability, your next big score is always within reach.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUltimate Bottle Flip Adventure is more than just flipping bottles; it's a test of skill, precision, and creativity. Whether you're looking for a quick flip or aiming to dominate the leaderboards, this game offers endless fun and challenges. So, are you ready to flip, soar, and blast your way to victory? Join the adventure today and become the ultimate bottle flipper!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrab your bottle, set your sights, and flip to greatness!",
            "short_description": "Welcome to Ultimate Bottle Flip Adventure, the ultimate test of skill and precision in the fun-filled world of bottle flipping. This game takes you on a unique journey across diverse environments, from bustling subway stations to the tranquil settings of parks and the zero-gravity thrill of space.",
